        comment     2026-11-12T07:04:32Z
            From the core consolidation design (round 3 handoff table, via @task.V3.T54 and @task.V3.T55): writes 
            arrive as a flat per-step list with `Due` derived; the final write is a ticket held in `Life`; the 
